WEBVTT

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:00.760
Esta máscara

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:01.360
esconde un

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:01.700
plan

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:03.500
explosivo.

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:05.400
Londres, 1605.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:05.920
Hartos de la

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:06.400
persecución

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.500
religiosa, unos

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.100
conspiradores

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:08.660
católicos

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:09.200
querían matar

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.480
al rey y volar

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:11.200
el parlamento.

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:12.200
Guy Fawkes

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:12.840
custodiaba

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.140
36

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:14.960
barriles de

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:15.880
pólvora, pero

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:16.780
una carta de

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:17.980
aviso desató la

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:18.400
búsqueda.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:19.260
Lo atraparon

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:19.700
antes de la

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:20.580
explosión y

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:20.980
acabó

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:21.580
ejecutado.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:22.880
El plan fracasó.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:23.660
Siglos después,

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:24.820
V de Vendetta

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:25.580
convirtió su

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:26.100
rostro en

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:26.940
símbolo de

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:27.420
rebelión.

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:28.860
La pólvora no

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:29.200
estalló.

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:30.740
La máscara sí

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:31.540
dio la vuelta al

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:32.000
mundo.

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:33.040
Suscríbete.
